      "options": {
        "content": "## production-rag observability\n\n- **Traces**: OTel spans (`@stage_span`) → collector → Tempo\n- **App metrics**: `ragcore.asks`, `ragcore.ask.latency`, `ragcore.ask.cost_usd` via OTLP\n- **In-process**: `GET /v1/metrics` (Bearer auth)\n- **Dashboards**: auto-provisioned from `infra/grafana/`\n\n```\nOTEL_ENABLED=true\nOTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://otel-collector:4317\n```\n\nEval baselines: `packages/core/evals/results/`.",
